{
  "id": 8867179626695,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 10",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-10",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom with a personalized touch with this custom baseball bedding comforter set from Jeminise. Designed for baseball enthusiasts, this set combines style, comfort, and a unique personalized element, making it a thoughtful gift for any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Perfect for baseball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating determination and passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques to prevent fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric with Whole-Piece Microfiber Filling, ensuring a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover, ensuring a complete and coordinated look for your bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your bedding with custom name and text inputs, adding a unique touch.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Baseball on US Flag 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Closure Type</th>\n<td>Zipper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
